        "p_b_note": "p_b taken from the observed population growth rate, which is the quantity section 0.2 says it tracks and which is dimensionally a rate. Its mean over the window is 0.0093. The formula the same section writes, (Y_dot + K_R_dot) / K_I_dot, averages 2.401 over this window, which is a flow ratio rather than a rate and is dimensionally inconsistent with the use the output equation puts p_b to. That discrepancy is a property of the source definition and is reported rather than patched.",
